<title>SWEDEN: Incentive says Gambro, Baxter reach accord.</title>
<headline>Incentive says Gambro, Baxter reach accord.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish investment company Incentive AB said on Wednesday its health care unit Gambro had reached an agreement to resolve its patent dispute with Baxter Healthcare of the United States.</p>
</text>
